  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "After the completion of iOS, it is time for a macOS client just like on Windows. You now have the knowledge to bring it there. We are extremely capable of running the platform, hell major VFX for motion pictures are rendered on us and always have been. You are the last remaining piece for us to have PCVR on mac for VRC. Steam, SteamVR, and Virtual Desktop are already here. Please do this, I'm tired of paying $60 a month to Shadow when I have a $7,000 mac that no windows machine in use with vrc can even compete against.\n\nWe are not a toy computer and we are many. Stop treating us like we don't exist.",
